Output public/pages/extensions/subagents/scene.mp4
Source tapes/common/settings.tape
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type "node scenes/run.mjs pages/extensions/subagents"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Show

Sleep 1s
# cue: enable
Type "/subagents on"
Sleep 350ms
Enter
Sleep 2200ms
# cue: request
Type "Ask a scout where the greeting is printed"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1800ms
# cue: running
Sleep 4500ms
# cue: result
Sleep 9s
